# eOn SVN r2549. HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel lj_cut.
# Plain NEB. Same band and optimizer as eon-svn/de-2ts-ci with climbing_image_method false. Five images, spring 5, L-BFGS memory 20, max_move 0.05, converged_force 0.001, max_iterations 250000. failure_cap is the problem cap, 250000. convergence_metric norm is the Euclidean force norm. The run swaps the named potential for ext_pot. The kernel is lj_cut, unshifted Lennard-Jones, epsilon 1, sigma 1, cutoff 40. The binary is SVN r2549 with the Fortran potentials linked.
counter harness
code Eon svn
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm NEB
tuning default
template eon-svn/de-2ts-neb
problem double-ended-saddle-search/lj38_2ts_separation
reducer harness
cap 250000
n 50
par2_mean 64605.32
nfailed 2
mean_calls 54605.32
median_calls 13424.5
min_calls 1022.0
max_calls 250000.0
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 2
n_wrong_stationary 0
partial true
